# 64-host, 3-tier scale-up fabric with 4:1 host-to-core oversubscription.
#
# Contiguous rank placement: groups of 4 ranks share a leaf; groups of 16 share
# a pod.  Each leaf has a 2:1 uplink taper and each aggregation tier has a 2:1
# taper, creating the locality-sensitive case for the Bine butterfly: large
# near-neighbour exchanges stay low in the tree, while global links are scarce.
# All links are 4000 Gbps (2 ps/B) and use the same latency primitives as the
# full-bisection scaleup_3tier_256_4000Gbps.topo reference.
Nodes 64
Tiers 3
Podsize 16

Tier 0
Downlink_speed_Gbps 4000
Radix_Down 4
Radix_Up 2
Downlink_Latency_ns 50
Switch_Latency_ns 300
Oversubscribed 2

Tier 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 4000
Radix_Down 4
Radix_Up 2
Downlink_Latency_ns 50
Switch_Latency_ns 300
Oversubscribed 2

Tier 2
Downlink_speed_Gbps 4000
Radix_Down 8
Bundle 2
Downlink_Latency_ns 50
Switch_Latency_ns 300
